844 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 349 0 R
/T (Ultimately, EYPE's economic analysis demonstrates that technological innovation overcomes the traditional tradeoff between ecology and profit. With a 90% reduction in water use and a yield per square meter up to 10 times higher than conventional agriculture, the project positions itself as a highly scalable solution. Economically, the model guarantees an extraordinary safety margin: the ability to maintain net profitability even in front of a potential 855% increase in material costs and the 95.9% success rate in stress tests confirm that hydroponic efficiency today represents a significant competitive advantage.)
/E (Ultimately, EYPE's economic analysis demonstrates that technological innovation overcomes the traditional tradeoff between ecology and profit. With a 90% reduction in water use and a yield per square meter up to 10 times higher than conventional agriculture, the project positions itself as a highly scalable solution. Economically, the model guarantees an extraordinary safety margin: the ability to maintain net profitability even in front of a potential 855% increase in material costs and the 95.9% success rate in stress tests confirm that hydroponic efficiency today represents a significant competitive advantage.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [3]
>>
