/Title (The modern era presents us with unprecedented challenges regarding the conscious use of resources, directly aligning with SDG 12: Responsible Consumption and Production. Currently, traditional agriculture accounts for roughly 70% of global freshwater withdrawals. In this context, it is crucial to pay particular attention to the conscious use of soil and water. The latter, being an increasingly scarce commodity, requires the most prudent and informed consumption. Adopting innovative solutions like hydroponic greenhouses addresses this exact issue, allowing for up to a 90% reduction in water usage and proving that we can produce more with less.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2935 0 R
>>
endobj
