/Title (Modern technology offers sophisticated tools to reduce waste without neglecting economic costs. In this analysis, I present EYPE \(Enjoy Your Plant Everywhere\), a hydroponic greenhouse that allows you to grow vegetables and greens while saving water and achieving economic benefits compared to traditional farming techniques. Beyond resource efficiency, EYPE maximizes spatial capacity. By optimizing the growing environment, hydroponic systems can achieve crop yields up to 10 times higher per square meter than conventional soil agriculture, making it a highly scalable solution for localized food production.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3054 0 R
>>
endobj
